  "title": "3-Bit x 3-Bit Binary Multiplier",
  "description": "Given two 3-bit binary numbers A (a2 a1 a0) and B (b2 b1 b0), design a circuit that produces the 6-bit product C (c5 c4 c3 c2 c1 c0) using AND gates and Full Adder circuits. Hint: generate the nine partial products ai.bj with AND gates and then add the shifted partial-product rows using two rows of full adders (a 7483 can be used as a 4-bit adder block).",
